  <item>
    <title>理财也能秀恩爱，小荷包是年轻情侣的家庭模拟</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b63abd33591c27bef8a931</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b63abd33591c27bef8a931</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Aug 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：将迎-小荷包产品经理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - 引入：支付宝小荷包产品经理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> - 支付宝小荷包的用户大概是个什么成分？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> - 支付宝小荷包是设计给年轻人用的产品吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">08:55</a> - 支付宝小荷包的使用场景足够丰富吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="626">10:26</a> - 支付宝小荷包是一个对未来婚姻生活的演练，或者走向更深深度关系的演练。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a> - 支付宝小荷包和支付宝本体有什么根本性的区别？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1096">18:16</a> - 支付宝小荷包隐喻了资产重组织的心理结构</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1371">22:51</a> - 支付宝小荷包的产品用户相关细节</span></p><span></span><p><span>一般来说一个用户会有几个小荷包？</span></p><span></span><p><span>情侣分手之后怎么处理？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1906">31:46</a> - 支付宝小荷包有什么特别的组织形式吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2179">36:19</a> - 支付宝小荷包的「荷包圈」这个产品的设计意义？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2647">44:07</a> - 支付宝小荷包的「荷包圈」功能的可能性还有什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>支付宝小荷包的「荷包圈」产品对于其他产品的差异化在于，对人性的人心里面那种价值东西，是荷包圈可能更倾向于用户去积极行动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2876">47:56</a> - 「小荷包」的「大荷包」可能性？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3112">51:52</a> - 小荷包的探索方向？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3246">54:06</a> - 支付宝小荷包的「剧本攒」功能的开发出发点是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3532">58:52</a> - 哪些用户会用「剧本攒」功能？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3679">1:01:19</a> - 对调了「花钱」与「攒钱」意义的反直觉设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3832">1:03:52</a> - 「剧本攒」功能的未来预期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3964">1:06:04</a> - 「剧本攒」功能的开发心路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4178">1:09:38</a> - 游戏化的产品开发趋势不可阻挡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4266">1:11:06</a> - 从统计上来说这几年年轻人是更喜欢存钱了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4345">1:12:25</a> - 支付宝小荷包的上限天花板在哪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4607">1:16:47</a> - 支付宝小荷包的「钱包」属性可能突破吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4855">1:20:55</a> - 对年轻人的理财或者财富积累的心得或者建议？</span></p>]]></description>
